  "variants": null,
  "_note": "Motorola MC6850 Asynchronous Communications Interface Adapter. Pin table audited against Motorola MC6850 datasheet (DS9493, rev 4). DIP-24 package. Full-duplex serial: TxD (pin 6), RxD (pin 2). Separate Tx/Rx clocks: TxCLK (pin 4), RxCLK (pin 3). Modem control: RTSB (pin 5, active low output), CTSB (pin 24, active low input), DCDB (pin 23, active low input). Bus interface: D0-D7 (pins 22-15), RS (pin 11, register select), E (pin 14, enable/clock), RW (pin 13, high=read). Three chip selects: CS0 (pin 8, active high), CS1 (pin 10, active high), CS2B (pin 9, active low). IRQB (pin 7, open drain). VSS=pin 1, VCC=pin 12. Searle Z80 preset: directly wired to Z80 bus, no VIA needed.",
